Overview :-
This Model Is Basically Help Us to know that Whether a person will Survived or not.
As this Model is Trained on Titanic Data Which is present in train.csv  .

-->>LIBRARIES USED :-
->NUMPY.
->PANDAS.
->MATPLOTLIB.
->SEABORN.
->SCIKET-LEARN.

->THis Project Include :-

1-EDA :-
Firstly I did Exploratory Data Analyse With The help of libraries ie-(Pandas,Numpy,Seaborn,Matplot,Sciket_learn).
Where I understand Relationship Amoung Various Column Present in dataset With the help of graph and eda.

2-HANDLING MISSING VALUES:-
Here,I handle missing data present in Age Column by filling vacant one with mean age.
And Filling Embarked empty column with "Most Frequent One" . 

3--PREPROCESSING :-
 Doing Encoding ie-Changing Categorical Value Into Numerical Value  On Column Sex,Embarked.
I Applied One Hot Encoding On Column Sex,Embarked. As There is Ordinal Order in These Column.
Also Applied Standard Scalling On Column Fare,Price As, It Help To Transfer Data ie-mean bcm 0,Standard Deviation 1.
Which Help To Perform Ml Model Better.

TOOL USED :-
Column Transformer,make_pipeline.

4--Machine Learning Model :-
I Checked accuracy,cross_val_score With the Help of Given Models ie-(Logistic Regression,Decision_Tree_Classifier,Random Forest).
I choosed these Model To check Accuracy Bcz This Model Is Basically Based On Supervised Learning Under a classissification Problem
And Based On Accuracy RANDOMFORESTCLASSIFIER gives best accuracy.

FUTURE GOAL :-
->MODEL_DEPLOYMENT.

